:: Start [nobar]
<<include "Banner">>
<div class="stamp">Case file 002</div>
<p class="meta">Alcatraz Federal Penitentiary · Tuesday, June 12, 1962 · 7:00 a.m.</p>
<h1>Count at Dawn</h1>
<p>The siren is still wailing across the island. You're the investigator on duty, and the warden is standing in the doorway of Clarence Anglin's cell, staring at a head on the floor.</p>
<p>It's made of soap.</p>
<p class="quote chief">"Three cells. Three fake heads. Morris and both Anglin brothers are gone, and nobody saw a thing. Find out how they got out, and how long they've been gone. You have six leads before the FBI takes over."</p>
<div class="how">
<p><b>How to investigate</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Visiting a new place uses one lead. Going back is free.</li>
<li>Nobody saw the escape. The evidence will tell you the story.</li>
<li>Allen West, the man left behind, will answer two questions. He's <b>one witness</b>, and he wasn't there for the end.</li>
<li>Put the escape in order on the <b>route board</b>. Connect clues on the <b>deduction board</b>. Both are free.</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="actions">[[Start investigating|Hub]]</div>


:: Hub
<<if $leads lte 0>><<goto "OutOfLeads">><</if>>
<<set _ev to setup.events.filter(function(e){ return $leads <= e.at && !$events.includes(e.id); })>>
<<for _e range _ev>><<run $events.push(_e.id)>>
<<if _e.kind is "headline">><div class="headline"><span class="paper">San Francisco Chronicle</span><<print _e.text>></div>
<<else>><p class="quote chief"><<print _e.text>></p><</if>>
<</for>>
<h2>Where to?</h2>
<p class="meta">New places cost a lead. Places you've visited are free to revisit.</p>
<<casemap>>
<details class="maplist"><summary>Show the places as a list</summary>
<ul class="map">
<li><<maplink "Cells" "🛏️ The three empty cells">></li>
<li><<maplink "West" "🗣️ Interview Allen West, the man left behind">></li>
<li><<maplink "Corridor" "🔦 The utility corridor behind the cells">></li>
<li><<maplink "Roof" "🏚️ The top of the cellblock and the roof">></li>
<li><<maplink "Shore" "🌊 Outside: the wall, the fences and the shore">></li>
<li><<maplink "Shops" "🧰 The prison shops and supply room">></li>
<li><<maplink "Music" "🪗 The music room and the barbershop">></li>
<li><<maplink "Guards" "📋 The guards' office: last night's count sheets">></li>
<li><<maplink "Dock" "📰 The dock, where reporters are gathering">></li>
</ul>
</details>
<div class="actions secondary"><<link "Route board (free)">><<set $return to "Hub">><<goto "Route">><</link>><<link "Deduction board (free)">><<set $return to "Hub">><<goto "Board">><</link>>[[I'm ready to report|Report]]</div>


:: OutOfLeads
<h2>Out of leads</h2>
<p class="quote chief">"Time's up," the warden says. "The FBI is here. Let's hear your report."</p>
<div class="actions"><<link "One last look at the route board">><<set $return to "OutOfLeads">><<goto "Route">><</link>><<link "One last look at the deduction board">><<set $return to "OutOfLeads">><<goto "Board">><</link>>[[Make your report|Report]]</div>


:: Route
<h2>Route board</h2>
<p class="meta">Tap the steps of the escape in the order they happened. You can only use steps you have evidence for. If a step couldn't have happened yet, the board will tell you why.</p>
<div id="rtboard"><<include "RouteCards">></div>
<div class="actions"><<link "Back">><<goto $return>><</link>></div>


:: RouteCards
<<set _all to setup.route.concat(setup.fakeRoute)>>
<<set _have to _all.filter(function(t){ return $notebook.includes(t.need); })>>
<<set _left to _have.filter(function(t){ return !$rt.includes(t.id); }).sort(function(a,b){ return a.text.localeCompare(b.text); })>>
<h3>The escape route so far</h3>
<<if $rt.length is 0>><p class="slot-empty">Nothing placed yet.</p>
<<else>><ol class="timeline"><<for _id range $rt>><li><<print _all.find(function(t){ return t.id === _id; }).text>></li><</for>></ol><</if>>
<<if $rmsg isnot "">><p class="note warn" role="status"><<print $rmsg>></p><</if>>
<<if _have.length is 0>><p class="note">You don't have any route evidence yet. The cells are a good place to start.</p>
<<elseif _left.length gt 0>>
<h3>Place next</h3>
<div class="choices">
<<for _t range _left>><<capture _t>><span class="opt"><<link _t.text>>
<<set _next to setup.route[$rt.length]>>
<<if _t.id.startsWith("f")>><<set $rmiss to $rmiss + 1>><<set $rmsg to "That step doesn't fit. " + _t.why>>
<<elseif _next and _t.id is _next.id>><<run $rt.push(_t.id)>><<set $rmsg to "">>
<<else>><<set $rmiss to $rmiss + 1>><<set $rmsg to "Not yet. " + _next.why + " What comes before “" + _t.text.toLowerCase() + "”?">><</if>>
<<replace "#rtboard">><<include "RouteCards">><</replace>><</link>></span><</capture>><</for>>
</div>
<<else>><p class="note">Every step you have evidence for is placed.</p><</if>>
<p class="meta">Steps placed: <<print $rt.length>> of <<print setup.route.length>> · Wrong tries: <<print $rmiss>></p>


:: Cells
<h2>The three empty cells</h2>
<<include "Scene">>
<p>Three cells a few doors apart on the same row. Each is about five feet wide and nine feet deep: a bed, a sink, a toilet, a shelf. In each bed, under the blanket, is a fake head. Behind each sink, low on the back wall, is a dark hole.</p>
<<clue "hole">>
<<clue "cardboard">>
<<clue "head">>
<<clue "magazine">>
<<tomap>>


:: West
<h2>Interview: Allen West</h2>
<p>Allen West's cell is next to the others. His vent cover is half chipped away. He looks tired and nervous, and he's decided to talk.</p>
<div id="ans"><<pastanswers "west">></div>
<div id="iv"><<interview "west">></div>
<<tomap>>


:: Corridor
<h2>The utility corridor</h2>
<p>A guard unlocks a steel door at the end of the cellblock. Behind the cells runs a narrow, dark corridor, three stories tall, crammed with water pipes, electric wires and air ducts. From in here, you can see the back of every vent hole.</p>
<<clue "corridor">>
<<clue "tools">>
<<clue "drill">>
<<tomap>>


:: Roof
<h2>The top of the cellblock</h2>
<p>You climb a ladder to the very top of the cellblock, where nobody goes. Someone has been very busy up here.</p>
<<clue "workshop">>
<<clue "extras">>
<<clue "roofvent">>
<<tomap>>


:: Shore
<h2>Outside: the wall, the fences and the shore</h2>
<p>Cold wind off the bay. You follow the marks from the roof to the ground, across the yard, and down to the rocks. The water is gray and fast.</p>
<<clue "pipe">>
<<clue "fences">>
<<clue "shore">>
<<tomap>>


:: Shops
<h2>The prison shops and supply room</h2>
<p>The supply officer is checking his lists for the third time.</p>
<p class="quote">"Raincoats. More than fifty of them, and I can't find any. And somebody's been helping himself to liquid plastic from the shops."</p>
<<clue "raincoats">>
<<clue "glue">>
<<tomap>>


:: Music
<h2>The music room and the barbershop</h2>
<p>Next to each other on the same hall. The music room still has an accordion case in the corner. In the barbershop, the barber is sweeping up.</p>
<<clue "accordion">>
<<clue "hair">>
<<tomap>>


:: Guards
<h2>The guards' office</h2>
<p>Last night's count sheets are on the desk. The night guards look miserable.</p>
<<clue "lightsout">>
<<clue "count">>
<<clue "found">>
<<tomap>>


:: Dock
<h2>The dock</h2>
<p>Boats full of reporters are already circling the island, shouting questions.</p>
<p class="quote">"Bet they dug a tunnel under the whole building," one yells. "No way they did it alone. Somebody inside helped," shouts another.</p>
<<clue "tunnel">>
<<clue "inside">>
<<tomap>>


:: Report [nobar]
<div class="stamp">Report</div>
<h2>Your report to the warden</h2>
<p class="quote chief">"Three things," the warden says. "How they got out, how long they've been gone, and where they were headed."</p>

<h3>1. The route</h3>
<<if $rt.length is 0>><p class="note">You haven't built the route. You can still go back to the board.</p><<else>><ol class="timeline"><<for _id range $rt>><li><<print setup.route.find(function(t){ return t.id === _id; }).text>></li><</for>></ol><</if>>
<div class="actions secondary"><<link "Edit the route">><<set $return to "Report">><<goto "Route">><</link>></div>

<h3>2. How big a head start did they have?</h3>
<div id="heads"><<include "HeadList">></div>

<h3>3. Where were they headed?</h3>
<div id="trusts"><<include "TrustList">></div>

<div id="file"><<include "ReportButton">></div>


:: HeadList
<<set _opts to [["two","About 2 hours"],["five","About 5 hours"],["nine","About 9 and a half hours"],["unknown","There's no way to tell"]]>>
<div class="choices"><<for _o range _opts>><<capture _o>><span @class="$head is _o[0] ? 'opt chosen' : 'opt'"><<link _o[1]>><<set $head to _o[0]>><<replace "#heads">><<include "HeadList">><</replace>><<replace "#file">><<include "ReportButton">><</replace>><</link>></span><</capture>><</for>></div>


:: TrustList
<<set _opts to [["certain","Angel Island. West told us, so that's certain."],["oneWitness","West says Angel Island, but he's one witness and wasn't there at the end."],["guess","Mexico. That's where escapers always go."]]>>
<div class="choices"><<for _o range _opts>><<capture _o>><span @class="$trust is _o[0] ? 'opt chosen' : 'opt'"><<link _o[1]>><<set $trust to _o[0]>><<replace "#trusts">><<include "TrustList">><</replace>><<replace "#file">><<include "ReportButton">><</replace>><</link>></span><</capture>><</for>></div>


:: ReportButton
<<if $head is "" or $trust is "">><p class="note">Choose a head start and where they were headed to file your report.</p>
<<else>><div class="actions">[[File my report|Verdict]]</div><</if>>


:: Verdict [nobar]
<<set $routeOk to $rt.length is setup.route.length>>
<<set _s1 to $routeOk and $rmiss lte 2>>
<<set _s2 to $head is "nine" and $notebook.includes("lightsout") and $notebook.includes("found")>>
<<set _s3 to $trust is "oneWitness" and $notebook.includes("plan")>>
<<set $stars to (_s1 ? 1 : 0) + (_s2 ? 1 : 0) + (_s3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<set $deductions to $notebook.filter(function(id){ return setup.cards[id].type === "deduction"; }).length>>
<<if $stars is 3>><div class="stamp solved">Report accepted</div><<else>><div class="stamp">Report filed</div><</if>>
<h2>Detective rating: <<print $stars>> of 3 stars</h2>
<ul class="stars">
<li @class="_s1 ? 'on' : 'off'"><span aria-hidden="true"><<print _s1 ? '★' : '☆'>></span> <b>The route, step by step.</b> <<if _s1>>All seven steps, in order<<if $rmiss gt 0>>, with only <<print $rmiss>> wrong <<print $rmiss is 1 ? "try" : "tries">><</if>>.<<elseif $routeOk>>All seven steps, but it took <<print $rmiss>> wrong tries. Ask "what had to happen first?" before each step.<<else>>Your route has <<print $rt.length>> of 7 steps. Some parts of the building were never searched.<</if>></li>
<li @class="_s2 ? 'on' : 'off'"><span aria-hidden="true"><<print _s2 ? '★' : '☆'>></span> <b>The head start.</b> <<if _s2>>Lights out at 9:30 p.m., head found at 7:00 a.m.: about nine and a half hours.<<elseif $head is "nine">>Right number, but you never collected the count sheets that prove it.<<else>>Check the count sheets: when did the lights go out, and when was the head found?<</if>></li>
<li @class="_s3 ? 'on' : 'off'"><span aria-hidden="true"><<print _s3 ? '★' : '☆'>></span> <b>Trusting the witness the right amount.</b> <<if _s3>>West's word is useful, but it's one witness, and he never saw the ending.<<elseif $trust is "certain">>West is one witness, and he never left his cell that night. Useful, but not certain.<<elseif $trust is "guess">>Nothing in the evidence points to Mexico. That's a guess.<<else>>You picked the careful answer, but you never asked West where they were going.<</if>></li>
</ul>
<p class="meta">Deductions worked out: <<print $deductions>> of <<print setup.dedTotal>></p>
<h3>Your notebook, flipped over</h3>
<<if $notebook.length is 0>><p class="note">You didn't collect any cards.</p><<else>>
<div class="cards reveal"><<for _id range $notebook>><div @class="'card ' + setup.cards[_id].type"><span class="tag"><<print setup.typeLabel[setup.cards[_id].type]>></span><span class="card-title"><<print setup.cards[_id].title>></span></div><</for>></div><</if>>
<div class="actions">[[What really happened|RealHistory]]</div>


:: RealHistory [nobar]
<h2>What really happened</h2>
<p>Investigators pieced the escape together exactly the way you did: from the holes, the tools, the workshop and the heads. Nobody saw any of it happen.</p>
<p>The three men left their cells after lights out at 9:30 p.m. Nobody knows the exact minute they pushed off from the shore. Allen West told investigators everything he knew, but he never saw the ending.</p>
<p>Within hours, boats and planes were searching the bay. What they found, and what they didn't, is your next case.</p>
<div class="lesson">
<h3>Your lesson as a trainee</h3>
<ul>
<li>When nobody saw it happen, the evidence tells the story.</li>
<li>Each step depends on the one before. Ask "what had to happen first?"</li>
<li>A witness can be useful and still not be certain.</li>
</ul>
</div>
<p class="note">Made up for this game: the warden's, supply officer's and reporters' words, and West's exact wording. The evidence and the events are based on the real case.</p>
<div class="actions">[[Finish case|CaseClosed]]</div>


:: CaseClosed [nobar]
<<include "Banner">>
<<run setup.reportResult()>>
<<run setup.lockerSave("002", $notebook)>>
<div class="stamp solved big">Case closed</div>
<h2>Case 002, Part 1 complete</h2>
<p>Detective rating: <b><<print $stars>> of 3</b>. Deductions: <b><<print $deductions>> of <<print setup.dedTotal>></b>.</p>
<p>Your evidence has been bagged for Part 2.</p>
<p>Tell Rocky the route you found, how big a head start they had, and your detective rating.</p>
<div class="actions secondary"><<link "Play again">><<run Engine.restart()>><</link>></div>


:: Banner [art]
<svg class="art" viewBox="0 0 640 220" role="img" aria-label="Alcatraz Island at dawn: the cellhouse and lighthouse on a rocky island, with a searchlight beam over the cold bay." preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice">
<defs><linearGradient id="sky3" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#3a4b66"/><stop offset=".55" stop-color="#e59a7a"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#f6d3a3"/></linearGradient></defs>
<rect width="640" height="220" fill="url(#sky3)"/>
<path d="M370 96 L640 40 L640 70 Z" fill="#fff6c8" opacity=".35"/>
<rect y="150" width="640" height="70" fill="#4f6577"/>
<g stroke="#c9d6e0" stroke-width="2" opacity=".45"><line x1="30" y1="170" x2="90" y2="170"/><line x1="140" y1="190" x2="220" y2="190"/><line x1="470" y1="176" x2="540" y2="176"/><line x1="560" y1="200" x2="620" y2="200"/></g>
<path d="M150 152 C190 120 240 112 300 110 C380 108 440 118 490 152 Z" fill="#3c3530"/>
<rect x="230" y="84" width="150" height="34" fill="#5a524b"/>
<g fill="#ffd98a"><rect x="242" y="92" width="6" height="8"/><rect x="258" y="92" width="6" height="8"/><rect x="274" y="92" width="6" height="8"/><rect x="290" y="92" width="6" height="8"/><rect x="306" y="92" width="6" height="8"/><rect x="322" y="92" width="6" height="8"/><rect x="338" y="92" width="6" height="8"/><rect x="354" y="92" width="6" height="8"/></g>
<rect x="362" y="56" width="10" height="40" fill="#d9d2c4"/><path d="M358 56 L376 56 L367 46 Z" fill="#a3231d"/><circle cx="367" cy="62" r="4" fill="#fff6c8"/>
<rect x="200" y="104" width="34" height="18" fill="#4a433d"/><rect x="420" y="112" width="28" height="12" fill="#4a433d"/>
</svg>


:: Scene [art]
<svg class="art scene" viewBox="0 0 640 170" role="img" aria-label="Inside a narrow cell: a bed with a fake head on the pillow under a blanket, and a dark hole behind the sink."><rect width="640" height="170" fill="#bfb8aa"/><g stroke="#6b6458" stroke-width="6"><line x1="20" y1="0" x2="20" y2="170"/><line x1="60" y1="0" x2="60" y2="170"/><line x1="100" y1="0" x2="100" y2="170"/></g><rect y="140" width="640" height="30" fill="#8f877a"/><rect x="170" y="96" width="250" height="40" rx="4" fill="#6f7b86"/><rect x="170" y="88" width="250" height="16" rx="6" fill="#55626e"/><ellipse cx="200" cy="88" rx="26" ry="14" fill="#f2efe6"/><circle cx="214" cy="80" r="15" fill="#e5c8a8"/><path d="M200 70 C210 62 228 64 230 76 C224 72 212 72 204 76 Z" fill="#5a3b25"/><rect x="480" y="70" width="70" height="30" rx="4" fill="#e8e4da" stroke="#9a9384" stroke-width="2"/><rect x="510" y="56" width="6" height="16" fill="#9a9384"/><rect x="494" y="112" width="40" height="26" fill="#2a2420"/><g stroke="#7a7266" stroke-width="2"><line x1="494" y1="120" x2="534" y2="120"/><line x1="494" y1="128" x2="534" y2="128"/></g></svg>


:: CaseTheme [stylesheet]
:root { --accent: #c0664a; }
#passages { border-top-color: var(--accent); }
h1 { color: var(--accent); }
.map a { border-left: 6px solid var(--accent); }
.map .opt.revisit a { border-left-color: var(--line); }
.actions a, .actions .macro-link { background: var(--accent); }
.actions.secondary a, .actions.secondary .macro-link { background: transparent; color: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); }
.headline { border-left: 6px solid var(--accent); }
.card { border-top-color: var(--accent); }
svg.art { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px; margin: 0 0 16px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.25); }
svg.art.scene { margin: 6px 0 14px; }


:: MapArt [art]
<svg viewBox='0 0 400 260' role='img' aria-label='A cutaway map of Alcatraz Island: the cellhouse with its cells, utility corridor and roof, the prison shops, the shore, and the dock, surrounded by the bay. Map of Alcatraz' preserveAspectRatio='xMidYMid slice'><rect width='400' height='260' fill='#8fb3c9'/><path d='M30 20 C120 0 300 5 360 30 C395 60 390 200 350 225 C280 255 100 250 40 220 C5 190 5 60 30 20 Z' fill='#cdbf9b' stroke='#9a8a63' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='22' y='14' width='255' height='118' fill='#b9b3a6' stroke='#6d675c' stroke-width='2'/><text x='150' y='128' font-family='Special Elite, Courier New, monospace' font-size='9' fill='#3f3a33' text-anchor='middle' >CELLHOUSE</text><rect x='30' y='70' width='14' height='18' fill='#8f897c'/><rect x='48' y='70' width='14' height='18' fill='#8f897c'/><rect x='66' y='70' width='14' height='18' fill='#8f897c'/><rect x='84' y='70' width='14' height='18' fill='#8f897c'/><rect x='102' y='70' width='14' height='18' fill='#8f897c'/><rect x='120' y='70' width='14' height='18' fill='#8f897c'/><rect x='138' y='70' width='14' height='18' fill='#8f897c'/><rect x='156' y='70' width='14' height='18' fill='#8f897c'/><rect x='174' y='70' width='14' height='18' fill='#8f897c'/><rect x='192' y='70' width='14' height='18' fill='#8f897c'/><rect x='210' y='70' width='14' height='18' fill='#8f897c'/><rect x='228' y='70' width='14' height='18' fill='#8f897c'/><rect x='246' y='70' width='14' height='18' fill='#8f897c'/><rect x='300' y='40' width='60' height='60' fill='#b9b3a6' stroke='#6d675c'/><text x='330' y='112' font-family='Special Elite, Courier New, monospace' font-size='8' fill='#3f3a33' text-anchor='middle' >Shops</text><g stroke='#5a5a5a' stroke-width='2'><line x1='300' y1='140' x2='370' y2='140'/><line x1='300' y1='150' x2='370' y2='150'/></g><text x='335' y='135' font-family='Special Elite, Courier New, monospace' font-size='7' fill='#5a4a3a' text-anchor='middle' >fences</text><rect x='110' y='205' width='70' height='10' fill='#8a6a3a'/><text x='145' y='228' font-family='Special Elite, Courier New, monospace' font-size='8' fill='#5a4a3a' text-anchor='middle' >dock</text><text x='40' y='250' font-family='Special Elite, Courier New, monospace' font-size='9' fill='#2f5872' text-anchor='start' >~ San Francisco Bay ~</text></svg>
